  "Question": "Connecting the midpoints of consecutive sides of quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\) forms quadrilateral \\(EFGH\\). Given that the diagonals have lengths \\(AC=8\\) and \\(BD=6\\), find the perimeter of quadrilateral \\(EFGH\\).",
  "Choices": {},
