  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Draw \\(AC\\) and \\(BD\\). By the midsegment theorem, \\(EF=HG=AC/2=4\\) and \\(FG=EH=BD/2=3\\). The perimeter is \\(2\\times(4+3)=14\\).",
